{"items":[{"id":"792418971","root":"792418971","user":{"id":"171588","name":"Va1ner","avatar":"814947bf3bbde29032ae258d"},"text":"感觉确实适合拍电视剧，电影一到金晨回国就剧情过的很快，说张艺兴是主演但戏份跟王大陆差不多[emot=acfun,1651/]","time":1691904945318,"floor":19,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792418865","root":"792418865","user":{"id":"76115","name":"冷颤不是病","avatar":"f8de28755fce93488ec190e8"},"text":"啊，刚想去看[emot=acfun,1652/]","time":1691904504563,"floor":18,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792414884","root":"792414884","user":{"id":"855261","name":"神设定","avatar":"db0b59a3d4b6e2847e992e44"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1656/]这种题材建议直接看纪录片之类的","time":1691890880101,"floor":17,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792413546","root":"792413546","user":{"id":"731290","name":"听风的优","avatar":"c6bb20a041bcd51b0f486515"},"text":"一个名下房产能抵押将近800万的…为了给女朋友买个5万的礼物去赌…\n还有最后男主就是被逼迫的不判刑…别人就不是被逼迫的？吃馒头还是有用啊…","time":1691883465386,"floor":16,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"792414295","root":"792413546","user":{"id":"348627","name":"渣丸子","avatar":"6bff8965b006724a4d9551ef"},"text":"是，王大陆篇不合理的地方太多了，就是为了冲突点满编了太多不合理的桥段，我还能说别的，比如在广州这种地方，黑恶势力居然敢直接控制王大陆父母，还摔死王大陆他们家的猫，更逗的是，看着拥有两套接近千万房产的高收入家庭，居然不乐意等他们取一百万还债，拉着王大陆去卖血（好奇现在国内还有这种黑医院卖血吗）而且完全不担心闹出人命，拉着连着几家医院抽，这确定是中国吗[emot=acfun,1657/]","time":1691888269121,"floor":1,"likes":2,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792415288","root":"792413546","user":{"id":"26480558","name":"千散龙儿","avatar":"227b4cda11e2a6d44b77d3c3"},"text":"确实，这么一想王大陆的家庭背景好像根本不需要玩赌博………","time":1691892372349,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"渣丸子","replyToUserId":"348627","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792416723","root":"792413546","user":{"id":"348627","name":"渣丸子","avatar":"6bff8965b006724a4d9551ef"},"text":"电影可能是出于教化宣传都需要，特意拔高了受骗者的学历与家庭层次，不仅是王大陆，张艺兴是大厂k6程序员，电影开始就用了连这种精英也会出事作为开始（电影开场白），估计是想给看电影的人说，连这种人都会，你可长点心吧，不过意思是好的，就是用力过猛","time":1691897378329,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"千散龙儿","replyToUserId":"26480558","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"792413321","root":"792413321","user":{"id":"556258","name":"CaesarK","avatar":"aa9230de4dd4f6bb8c86ba56"},"text":"浅显又直白的法制节目plus版","time":1691881409618,"floor":15,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792413260","root":"792413260","user":{"id":"1417313","name":"初初空","avatar":"78c4f327dee5415088e85203"},"text":"被朋友带着去看的，剧情就是现实故事的整合，最大的负体验是演员方面，特别是那个支线男的女友，每次看到她就很出戏，还有宣传味有点多，感觉一直在看宣传广告","time":1691880644304,"floor":14,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792410900","root":"792410900","user":{"id":"13043860","name":"天使与撒旦","avatar":"583845dfab7da707edfdaa1b"},"text":"[emot=acfun,2445/]","time":1691870740908,"floor":13,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792408260","root":"792408260","user":{"id":"12773458","name":"通利福尼亚吴彦祖","avatar":"d4ff9c8aabf77b9aafaf61e6"},"text":"感觉人物都特别脸谱化，内里没有驱动力[emot=acfun,1793/]","time":1691856303630,"floor":12,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"792409049","root":"792408260","user":{"id":"348627","name":"渣丸子","avatar":"6bff8965b006724a4d9551ef"},"text":"是，这个电影有比较严重都堆料，或者应该说目的不是讲好一个故事，而是把诈骗这个事情讲清楚（所以王大陆的支线也讲的特别清楚，占了超过四分之一的时长了吧，如果要围绕一个核心把故事讲清楚，这段有大量内容可以删）","time":1691858012584,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792409472","root":"792408260","user":{"id":"12773458","name":"通利福尼亚吴彦祖","avatar":"d4ff9c8aabf77b9aafaf61e6"},"text":"也许可以打磨打磨剧本像无间道一样拍成三部曲，不过这是制作组和投资方考虑的问题了[emot=acfun,1800/]","time":1691859757809,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"渣丸子","replyToUserId":"348627","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"792407226","root":"792407226","user":{"id":"30656494","name":"何欢何来","avatar":"65abef69206f9ae216c07d32"},"text":"张艺兴演得咋样？和《人生大事》里面的朱一龙比如何？","time":1691854358734,"floor":11,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"792409007","root":"792407226","user":{"id":"348627","name":"渣丸子","avatar":"6bff8965b006724a4d9551ef"},"text":"我个人觉得前期还行（他很适合演这种懦弱的角色，不过后期出现一些大起大落剧情时，能看到他之前演戏常见的一种发愣表情，勉强及格吧）","time":1691857857778,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"792405233","root":"792405233","user":{"id":"28018140","name":"鱼总A4TYPHOON","avatar":"dd6976b9cf261c6fbb55ed91"},"text":"确实是二流片，但是二流片也是属于值得看的二流片。这电影拍出来上线本身已经远远超过了电影本身的意义，我还是会给每个人都推荐这个电影，他很值得看。就当给自己做个功课也值得看，我更希望，初中高中都组织一下，集体去看这个电影，我觉得生命中看一次这个电影，完全不亏","time":1691851203730,"floor":10,"likes":42,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":5,"hot":true,"replyPreview":[{"id":"792405462","root":"792405233","user":{"id":"348627","name":"渣丸子","avatar":"6bff8965b006724a4d9551ef"},"text":"也对，普及意义也很重要","time":1691851775547,"floor":1,"likes":4,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792406639","root":"792405233","user":{"id":"28018140","name":"鱼总A4TYPHOON","avatar":"dd6976b9cf261c6fbb55ed91"},"text":"这个电影，从技术层面来说，剧本，人物刻画，各方面都有很多问题，甚至不少粗糙的地方。但从观众角度来说，值不值得看是另一个问题。文艺作品优不优秀，除了他技术精不精湛之外，还要看他传达的一些情感有没有传达，虽然角色有不少地方设计的稀碎，但他想传达的东西，我觉得已经做饭了。这么稀碎的角色，也是辛苦了几个演员，演技也挽回了不少逻辑问题","time":1691853567404,"floor":1,"likes":8,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"渣丸子","replyToUserId":"348627","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792412486","root":"792405233","user":{"id":"1554881","name":"楓笛武曲","avatar":"ea55c702249d94d4064d2407"},"text":"我认为都要讲粤语了，无安排“生舊叉烧好过生你”这句台词不够合理[emot=acfun,1695/]","time":1691872951964,"floor":1,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"鱼总A4TYPHOON","replyToUserId":"28018140","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"792403638","root":"792403638","user":{"id":"955122","name":"肥嘟嘟的左卫门","avatar":"291b7ca15873c846ae88be45"},"text":"2流片子，评价有点高了[emot=acfun,1656/]","time":1691846506765,"floor":9,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792402389","root":"792402389","user":{"id":"1403959","name":"新世界的潜在犯","avatar":"30c053d3054f80f8c524fd32"},"text":"丸子老师总结的很到位了，电影想表达诈骗的黑暗面可是表现得又很克制，放生那段即使前面有几处铺垫但还是很突兀且不合理，他不可能想不到这次沸羊羊行为的后果有多严重。只能说电影从一开始的定位就是宣传片。","time":1691843430542,"floor":8,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"792405682","root":"792402389","user":{"id":"17532386","name":"我的梦中无人想","avatar":"86d9b1932183691ecee05db0"},"text":"知乎有人发了自己去参观那里的回答，看了一下，像是真的[emot=acfun,1656/]","time":1691852262049,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"792401791","root":"792401791","user":{"id":"64405","name":"动力木头","avatar":"503386a7ccd4fe029a050dbb"},"text":"[at uid=28018140]@鱼总A4TYPHOON[/at] ","time":1691841591173,"floor":7,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{